2. Surgical Fix

The defective logic:

app_settings.limit(1)
+
email/company lookup
+
automatic INSERT

was removed.

The new logic is:

Authenticated JWT
        ↓
auth.users.id
        ↓
public.users.id
        ↓
public.users.company_id
        ↓
company-scoped Runsheet

Specifically:

select id, company_id
from users
where id = authenticated_user.id

Then:

companyId = pubUser.company_id

No automatic public.users creation remains.

No password hashing exists in the new function.

No app_settings.limit(1) exists.

No inventory operation exists.

No reservation is introduced.

